  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“是我就安全了吗？……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You think you are safe because it is me? ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "别做梦喽！……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Keep dreaming! ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "就这一点，你们大错特错了！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "On that point, you are completely wrong!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "偏巧我不是个流浪汉……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As it happens, I am no vagrant ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我老老实实地纳税，有正式的户籍……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I pay my taxes honestly, and I have a proper family register ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "就现在，已经有人给警察局发了‘寻人启事’，肯定会出大事的！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "By now, someone must already have filed a missing person report with the police, and this is sure to become a serious matter!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "还不明白吗，这些事情……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do you still not understand all this? ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "你究竟要我说什么才打算辩解呢？……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What exactly do you expect me to say before you will even try to explain yourselves? ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "快，去把负责人叫来……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hurry, go call the person in charge ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00347",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "我要好好说给他听听，你们干了件多么愚蠢的事！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am going to make him understand just what a stupid thing you have done!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
